      "id": "alleycat",
      "name": "Alleycat courier",
      "category": "mission",
      "summary": "Pick up and deliver fragile packages through Downtown Los Santos traffic against the clock.",
      "description": "Random pickup and drop-off points in Downtown Los Santos, marked on the map with a GPS route; you choose your own line through traffic. Packages are fragile: hitting a car, a kerb or a wall, or falling, damages the one you carry, and at 0% it is lost. Heavy packages bring a storm and a headwind that GTBike V sends to your trainer as extra resistance; rain also lowers grip. The clock starts at the first pickup. Not available while a course is loaded; loading one ends the mission.",
