      "id": "survivalSprint",
      "name": "Survival sprint",
      "category": "training",
      "summary": "Pass the target speed and a truck appears behind you. Hold the speed and keep pedalling or it runs you down.",
      "description": "For threshold and high-intensity intervals, best on long roads such as the canals or the coast highway. Once you pass the target speed a chaser appears behind you. While you hold the target speed and keep pedalling it keeps its distance, and riding faster opens the gap a little. Below the target speed, for example on a climb, or coasting for longer than the grace time (GTBike V power and cadence near zero, even downhill at speed), it closes in fast. If it reaches you it rams you. Survive the set time to win. Works on a GTBike V course too.",
