      "name": "Ghost segments",
      "category": "training",
      "summary": "Timed segments you mark on the map. Race a see-through ghost of your best attempt and beat your record.",
      "description": "Mark segments on the PC window map (right-click: Ghost segment start here, then Ghost segment finish here; the same point twice makes a loop). With this add-on on, riding through a start circle starts the clock and a see-through ghost rider replays your best attempt (or your last one); the screen shows the live gap, green when you are ahead. The finish saves the attempt, and a faster one becomes the new record and the new ghost. Records keep the date, average power and speed. Teleporting cancels an attempt. Works on a GTBike V course too.",
